    :math:`(N, C_{\text{in}}, L)` and output :math:`(N, C_{\text{out}}, L_{\text{out}})` can be
    precisely described as:

    .. math::
        \text{out}(N_i, C_{\text{out}_j}) = \text{bias}(C_{\text{out}_j}) +
